  "label": "general internet audience",
  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with internet humor, absurd juxtapositions, and meme culture. The target community includes individuals who appreciate shock value, satire, and visual puns, particularly those who understand the cultural context of mislabeling images for comedic effect. The humor relies on the audience recognizing the mundane scene (baby exploring a dishwasher) and the absurdity of the text ('rare picture of child birth'), which requires a baseline understanding of internet memes and their conventions.",
